		"a finding heading with detail items":  "## High\n\n### 1. Unbounded retry (retry.go:42)\n- **Problem:** the loop never stops on 503.\n- **Impact:** a hung worker.\n- **Fix:** cap attempts at 5.\n\n## Medium\n\nNone.",
